  "proof": "For r=b+h*nu the projection toT-perp has square q(h)=2-(T.r)^T J_T(T.r). Each saved shifted polynomial has all3coefficients strictly negative. Acuteness or coherence plus the minimum nonright Coxeter product puts h at or above that shift. Hence q(h)<0 throughout the entire admissible real halfline, so the hyperplane misses the hyperbolicT-face.",
  "completeness": "The eight A7 records cover both signs of the one-dimensional positive direction and both endpoint contacts at both cusps. Any change of that direction by a multiple ofnu is absorbed into the arbitrary real height. This covers the specified norm2 affineA7 endpoint completion; it does not enumerate other affine link types or altered old walls.",
  "scope": "Exact all-real parameter obstruction within the fixed affineE8 plus endpoint-affineA7 cusp-completion profiles. Lowering heights, making heights unequal, or reversing the transverse direction cannot add a facet to the targetH3. Other cusp completion diagrams and other endpoint profiles remain open."
